  "body": "## Description\nCurrent test suite takes 10+ minutes to run completely, slowing down development and CI/CD.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Unit tests run in <2 minutes\n- [ ] Integration tests run in <5 minutes\n- [ ] E2E tests run in <10 minutes\n- [ ] NixOS VM tests optimized or parallelized\n- [ ] CI/CD pipeline optimized\n\n## Rationale\nSlow feedback loops reduce developer productivity and increase CI costs.\n\n## Scope\n- Implement test parallelization\n- Add selective test execution based on file changes\n- Optimize NixOS VM test environments\n- Update CI/CD configuration\n\n## Dependencies\nIssue #6377 (architecture improvements)\n\n## Priority\nHigh - Developer productivity critical",
